{"sections":[{"slug":"广义相对论中的复几何","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"广义相对论中的复几何"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">广义相对论中的复几何</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“广义相对论中的复几何”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Einstein场方程","text":"Einstein <span lang=\"zh\">场方程</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Ric}=\\lambda g\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复度规的符号是</span> $0$:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\tds^2 &amp;= (dz_1)^2 +\\cdots+(dz_n)^2\\\\\r\n\t&amp;=(dx_1)^2+\\cdots+(dx_n)^2 -(dy_1)^2-\\cdots-(dy_n)^2 +\r\n\t2i(dx_1dy_1+\\cdots)\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">想象</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Minkowski时空","text":"Minkowski <span lang=\"zh\">时空</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是复空间的一个切片</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">作</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Wick旋转","text":"Wick <span lang=\"zh\">旋转</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">点源的复变换</span> (?)</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/广义相对论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">广义相对论</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}